    "canonicalUrl": "https://quasar.dev/vue-components/tab-panels",
    "content": "Tab panels are a way of displaying more information using less window real estate.\n\n::: tip\nWorks great along with [QTabs](/vue-components/tabs) but it is not required to be used with it.\n:::\n\nAPI reference: QTabPanels\n\nAPI reference: QTabPanel",
